  "description": "The **Warehouse Sensors Group** (record ID\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a0012345678) was created on\u202f2023\u201107\u201115\u202fat\u202f12:34:56\u202fUTC and most recently updated on\u202f2024\u201101\u201120\u202fat\u202f09:15:30\u202fUTC. It is identified internally by the experience\u2011group identifier\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a0012345679 and belongs to application\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a001234567a. The group\u2019s name and description are \u201cWarehouse Sensors Group\u201d and \u201cGroup of IoT devices monitoring environmental conditions in the main warehouse.\u201d Two users are associated with the group \u2013\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a001234567b and\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a001234567c \u2013 and two endpoints \u2013\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a001234567d and\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a001234567e. Tags applied at the group level are **environment=production** and **team=analytics**. The group manages two devices (IDs\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a001234567f and\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a0012345680) which carry the device tags **location=warehouse** and **type=temperature_sensor**. The devices are selected by the query JSON\u202f`{\"type\":\"sensor\",\"status\":\"active\"}` and the group has no parent (parentId\u202f=\u202fnull).\n\nThe query that returned this record was executed against application\u202f5f1d7f1e8b9c0a0012345690, filtering on **status=active**, sorting by **creationDate** in ascending order. The request requested page\u202f1 with a page size of\u202f20, yielding a total of\u202f10 matching groups; the current page contains\u202f1 item, as reflected in the count."
